  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0001",
      "text": "gHYBR mints too few shares on deposit by using post-deposit totalAssets, causing systematic depositor value loss",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 112,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0002",
      "text": "The `GovernanceHYBR.deposit()` function calculates shares using `totalAssets()` that already includes the new deposit, resulting in systematic under-minting of shares to depositors. The function adds HYBR to the veNFT (increasing `totalAssets`) before calling `calculateShares()`, causing the share calculation to use an inflated denominator. This transfers value from new depositors to existing shareholders on every single deposit.",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 547,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0003",
      "text": "---",
      "start": 549,
      "end": 552,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0004",
      "text": "## Vulnerability Details",
      "start": 554,
      "end": 578,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0005",
      "text": "### The Problem",
      "start": 580,
      "end": 595,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0006",
      "text": "The `GovernanceHYBR` contract implements a vault system where users deposit HYBR and receive gHYBR shares representing proportional ownership. The fundamental accounting principle for vaults is:",
      "start": 597,
      "end": 791,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0007",
      "text": "However, `GovernanceHYBR` violates this principle by:",
      "start": 794,
      "end": 847,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0008",
      "text": "1. First depositing HYBR into the veNFT (increasing `totalAssets`)",
      "start": 848,
      "end": 914,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0009",
      "text": "2. Then calculating shares using the already-increased `totalAssets`",
      "start": 915,
      "end": 983,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_973cfee481ce_0010",
      "text": "This causes the denominator in the share calculation to be inflated, resulting in fewer shares minted than the depositor deserves.",
      "start": 985,
      "end": 1115,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
